      "widgets_values": [
        "LUT Export — turn a colour grade into a .cube file.\n\nHALD Identity makes a neutral colour chart; grade it with colour-only nodes (Tone Curve, ColorLab, HSL…), then LUT Export writes ComfyUI/output/pixelpro_demo.cube. The LUT works in LUT Import and in apps that read Adobe .cube. Do not blur, sharpen or resize between HALD Identity and LUT Export."
